WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
My new book,
How Not to Age,

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:04.080
is out now!

00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:06.800
If you’ve already preordered,
your book is on its way.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:07.720
If you didn’t,

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:09.120
head to your local
public library

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.160
or favorite bookseller
to pick up a copy.

00:00:12.160 --> 00:00:14.080
And if you’re gonna
get a stack

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:16.320
for everyone on your
holiday gift list,

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:18.440
please consider buying
them this week,

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:20.920
as first-week sales will
determine placement

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.320
on the New York Times
Best Seller list.

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.720
Fingers crossed How Not to Age
jumps to number one

00:00:26.720 --> 00:00:30.280
so even more people will learn how
to take better care of themselves

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:32.000
and their loved ones.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:36.160
I can’t wait for you to dive in and
hope you are as excited as I am

00:00:36.160 --> 00:00:40.040
about the amazing science out there
on slowing the aging process

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.784
with evidence-based nutrition.

